<title>FINLAND: PARTEK 1997 PROFIT SEEN UP ON SISU - PAPER.</title>
<headline>PARTEK 1997 PROFIT SEEN UP ON SISU - PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo handling equipment Partek Oy's 1997 profit after financial items and tax is seen rising to 350-400 million markka following Partek's acquisition of state-owned vehicle maker Sisu, daily Kauppalehti reported on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The forecast is based on the assumption that Sisu will be included for the whole reporting period and that none of the operations will be divested at the start of 1997,&quot; Kauppalehti said.</p>
<p>It referred to projections by unidentified analysts.</p>
<p>Partek is expected to post a 200 million markka profit after financial items for 1996 compared to 270 million markka in 1995, the paper said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
